WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:02.462
Your agent built the whole page.

00:02.462 --> 00:03.882
One button is wrong.

00:03.882 --> 00:04.625
Naturally.

00:05.500 --> 00:06.837
So you do the ritual.

00:06.837 --> 00:07.792
Screenshot it.

00:07.792 --> 00:09.511
Draw the little red arrow.

00:09.511 --> 00:10.912
Paste it in the chat.

00:10.912 --> 00:14.350
Then write three sentences explaining your own arrow.

00:15.700 --> 00:17.323
And it fixes a button.

00:17.323 --> 00:18.725
Just not that one.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.380
The annotator built into your AI app?

00:22.380 --> 00:23.603
It takes comments.

00:23.603 --> 00:25.276
It won't take your voice.

00:25.276 --> 00:27.334
It won't let you fix the words.

00:27.334 --> 00:29.200
And it only talks to itself.

00:30.300 --> 00:32.414
Show and Tell lives on the page.

00:32.414 --> 00:34.000
Not in a picture of it.

00:35.800 --> 00:37.148
Point at the thing.

00:37.148 --> 00:38.425
The actual thing.

00:40.300 --> 00:41.116
Wrong words?

00:41.116 --> 00:43.225
Type the right ones over them.

00:45.300 --> 00:47.078
Writers, this one's yours.

00:47.078 --> 00:50.225
Every word on the page, open like a document.

00:52.630 --> 00:53.690
Or skip the typing.

00:53.970 --> 00:54.530
Just yap.

00:54.980 --> 00:57.010
Click this, box that, keep talking.

00:57.480 --> 00:59.480
It's transcribed on your own machine, free.

00:59.920 --> 01:03.000
And every sentence comes back pinned to whatever you were pointing at.

01:04.550 --> 01:06.260
Then send the whole round to your agent.

01:06.780 --> 01:09.280
Every note, pinned to its exact element.

01:09.750 --> 01:11.420
Whichever one you're loyal to this week.

01:12.200 --> 01:13.998
It comes back with receipts.

01:13.998 --> 01:15.026
What you asked.

01:15.026 --> 01:15.925
What changed.

01:18.000 --> 01:18.814
Looks right?

01:18.814 --> 01:19.357
Say so.

01:19.357 --> 01:21.325
If it doesn't, send it back.

01:23.170 --> 01:23.940
Fewer rounds.

01:24.240 --> 01:25.240
Less usage burned.

01:25.440 --> 01:26.490
You, still in charge.

01:26.850 --> 01:28.690
And it works on anything built in code.

01:29.290 --> 01:31.480
Websites, designs, videos, tools.

01:31.780 --> 01:33.240
These days, that's everything.

01:34.200 --> 01:35.269
Show and Tell.

01:35.269 --> 01:36.950
Retire the red arrow.
